// Title: Outlook Security Settings Updated - Registry
// Sigma ID: c3cefdf4-6703-4e1c-bad8-bf422fc5015a
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-12-28 | Modified: 2026-01-09
// ATT&CK: persistence, T1137
// Description: Detects changes to the registry values related to outlook security settings
// False positives:
//   - Administrative activity
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1137/T1137.md
//   - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/outlook/troubleshoot/security/information-about-email-security-settings
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_office_outlook_security_settings.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where (RegistryKey endswith "\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Office*" and RegistryKey endswith "\\Outlook\\Security*") and (not(((InitiatingProcessFolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\" or InitiatingProcessFolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\") and InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\OUTLOOK.EXE")))
